WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A white Joby prototype flies above a dry field and trees. On-screen text says the collected test data will be analyzed over several months. This is NASA context footage, not a demonstration of the paper’s controller. No audio.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A closer shot shows the aircraft and its spinning rotors against a clear sky. On-screen text describes a future role for advanced air mobility in passenger and cargo transportation.
